# ESLint (@falcondev-oss/configs, antfu-based) owns these file types and has its
# own stylistic rules — running Prettier on them too would cause a formatter
# fight. Prettier is kept only for the types ESLint does not format (CSS/HTML,
# e.g. a GNOME `stylesheet.css`).
**/*.ts
**/*.js
**/*.mjs
**/*.cjs
**/*.json
**/*.jsonc
**/*.yml
**/*.yaml

# Hand-maintained docs and user-provided static assets
**/*.md
assets/

# Generated / vendored
node_modules/
gnome-extension/dist/
package-lock.json
*.shell-extension.zip
